#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:274
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:234
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:274
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#: rc.cpp:140 rc.cpp:169
msgid "Regular expression to find the type of the element"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Element-Typ söcht warrt"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:242
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:282
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:242
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:282
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#: rc.cpp:143 rc.cpp:172
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the type of the element. The pattern is searched "
"on the result of the <i>DefinitionRx</i> match and the first captured area "
"will hold the element type.<br>\n"
"Example (simplified):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"This will match strings like <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Now this string is "
"searched and it will find <b>new foo;</b>, where <b>foo</b> is the first "
"captured text (the regular expression matching <b>foo</b> is between "
"brackets).<br>\n"
"So the type of <b>$fooObj</b> is <b>foo</b>."
msgstr ""
"Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Element-Typ söcht warrt. Dat Muster warrt in't "
"Resultaat vun den <i>Definitschoon-RU</i>-Dreper söcht un dat toeerst passen "
"Söökresultaat bargt den Element-Typ.<br>\n"
"Bispill (vereenfacht):<br>\n"
"<b>Definitschoon-RU=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"Typ-RU=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"Dat passt op Tekenkeden as <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Nu warrt na disse "
"Tekenkeed söcht un <b>new foo;</b> funnen, wo binnen <b>foo</b> dat eerst "
"Söökresultaat is (de op <b>foo</b> passen reguleer Utdruck is in Klemmen)."
"<br>\n"
"De Typ vun <b>$fooObj</b> is denn also <b>foo</b>."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:249
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:314
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:249
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:314
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#: rc.cpp:151 rc.cpp:195
msgid "Regular expression to find the usage of a group element"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Bruuk vun en Koppelelement söcht warrt"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:261
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:326
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:261
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:326
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#: rc.cpp:154 rc.cpp:198
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the usage of a group element in the document."
"<br>\n"
"Example 1:<br>\n"
"- classes are defined as  <b>class foo {...}</b><br>\n"
"- classes are used as <b>$objFoo</b><br><br>\n"
"Example 2:<br>\n"
"- variables are defined as <b>int i</b><br>\n"
"- variables are used as <b>@i</b><br><br>\n"
"Example 3:<br>\n"
"- variables are defined as <b>$i</b><br>\n"
"- variables are used as <b>$i</b>. In this case <i>UsageRx </i>is the same "
"as <i>DefinitionRx</i>."
msgstr ""
"Reguleer Utdruck, mit den de Bruuk vun en Koppelelement binnen en Dokment "
"söcht warrt.<br>\n"
"Bispill 1:<br>\n"
"- Klassen warrt as <b>class foo {...}</b> fastleggt<br>\n"
"- Klassen warrt mit <b>$objFoo</b> bruukt<br><br>\n"
"Bispill 2:<br>\n"
"- Variabeln warrt as <b>int i</b> fastleggt<br>\n"
"- Variabeln warrt mit <b>@i</b> bruukt<br><br>\n"
"Bispill 3:<br>\n"
"- Variabeln warrt as <b>$i</b> fastleggt<br>\n"
"- Variabeln warrt mit <b>$i</b> bruukt. Denn is <i>Bruuk-RU </i>dat sülvige "
"as <i>Definitschoon-RU</i>."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:264
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
