#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:552
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:295
