#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1240
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1119
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1240
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:798 rc.cpp:870
msgid "Tags and attributes defining this DTEP"
msgstr "Betekers un Attributen, de disse DTEP fastleggt"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1126
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1247
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1126
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1247
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#: rc.cpp:801 rc.cpp:873
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of tags that define this DTEP. The format used is "
"<i>tagname(attribute[defaultvalue])</i>. If the parent (a real) DTEP has a "
"tag with <i>tagname</i> and\n"
"the <i>attribute value</i> of this tag is equal with the name of this DTEP, "
"the tag area\n"
"is parsed according to the rules of this DTEP.<br>\n"
"If <i>[defaultvalue]</i> is present, it means that if the attribute is not "
"present in the tag it is taken as present with <i>value = defaultvalue</i>."
"<br>\n"
"Example: <b>Tags=style(type[text/css])</b> means that both <b>&lt;style&gt;</"
"b> and <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> are treated the same way "
"and the DTEP defined by this tag is named <b>text/css</b>."
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Betekers, de disse DTEP fastleggt. As Formaat "
"warrt <i>Betekernaam(Attribut[Standardweert])</i> bruukt. Wenn de överornt "
"(en rejell) DTEP en Beteker mit <i>Betekernaam</i> bargt un\n"
"dissen Beteker sien <i>Attributweert</i> liek mit den Naam vun disse DTEP "
"is, warrt dat Beteker-Rebeet\n"
"na de Regeln vun disse DTEP inleest.<br>\n"
"Is en <i>[Standardweert]</i> angeven, warrt de Betekers mit fehlen Attribut "
"bruukt, as stunn dat Attribut mit <i>Weert = Standardweert</i> dor binnen."
"<br>\n"
"Bispill: <b>Betekers=style(type[text/css])</b> bedüüdt, dat <b>&lt;style&gt;"
"</b> un <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> liek behannelt warrt un "
"de DTEP, de mit dissen Beteker fastleggt warrt, <b>text/css</b> heet."

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1129
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#: rc.cpp:808
msgid "Definition tags:"
msgstr "Definitschoon-Betekers:"

