"==================== \t=========  \t==============================\n"
"indent-spaces\t\t\tInteger    \t0, 1, 2, ...\n"
"wrap\t\t\t\tInteger    \t0 (no wrapping), 1, 2, ...\n"
"tab-size\t\t\t\tInteger    \t0, 1, 2, ...\n"
